# Public configuration template for `emporio-agent chat`. Placeholders only.
#
# The application does NOT load this file or any .env file. `chat` reads only
# the process environment. Set the variables in the current terminal, as shown
# in README.md ("Configuration"); do not write a real key into any file.
#
# Never commit a filled copy of this file. Never paste a key into documentation,
# examples, issues or the chat.

# Required. Your OpenAI API key. Never printed or logged by the application.
OPENAI_API_KEY=<your-openai-api-key>

# Required, no default. Tested value: gpt-5.4-mini.
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.4-mini

# OPENAI_LOG must NOT be set: `chat` refuses to start when it is present.
